     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2/s",
     "description": "twice the shear viscosity etax2 = epp2i*zetax2 (visc_replpress, F90:2471; dump column etax2). Area-weighted corner value (kg/m2/s), [kg/m2/s]"
